flowCapability('animatedClouds','Animated cloud field','noirClouds');flowCapability('risingSmoke','Rising smoke','battleSmoke');flowCapability('groundFog','Low foreground fog','battleFog');
registerCapability('template:battle',{label:'Glide into the conflict',category:'Template actions',panel:'battle',render(ctx,age){renderBattle(ctx,age)}});
registerCapability('fireball',{label:'Fire & expanding blast','category':'VFX',panel:'battle',render(ctx,age){prepareBattleFlames(age,fx);battleRenderer?.panel(ctx,age,{...fx,battleLayers:{soldiers:false,terrain:false,fireball:true,smoke:false,flashes:false,fog:false}},sprites,{transparent:true})}});
registerCapability('soldierVolley',{label:'Soldiers · staggered firing',category:'VFX',panel:'battle',render(ctx,age){battleRenderer?.panel(ctx,age,{...fx,battleLayers:{soldiers:true,terrain:false,fireball:false,smoke:false,flashes:true,fog:false}},sprites,{transparent:true})}});
const battleCSS=document.createElement('style');battleCSS.textContent='#battleControls input[type=number],#battleControls select,#flowFields input[type=number]{width:100%;background:#191e26;color:#eee;border:1px solid #3b4350;padding:8px;border-radius:5px}#battleControls label,#flowFields label{display:block;margin:10px 0}#battleVisibility{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:4px}#battleVisibility label{font-size:11px}#battleVisibility input{margin-right:6px}.battlePickSurface{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:42;pointer-events:none;cursor:crosshair}#flowCanvas{width:100%;touch-action:none}.effectStages{overflow-x:auto;justify-content:flex-start}.effectStages button{flex:1;min-width:45px}';document.head.append(battleCSS);syncDuration();
// Repaint after viewport/tab/context restoration instead of reusing a stale cached frame.
let battleRepaintPending=false;function invalidateBattleFrame(){base._renderKey='';blankPaintKey='';if(battleRepaintPending)return;battleRepaintPending=true;requestAnimationFrame(()=>{battleRepaintPending=false;frame(base,t)})}
window.addEventListener('resize',invalidateBattleFrame);window.addEventListener('pageshow',invalidateBattleFrame);document.addEventListener('visibilitychange',()=>{if(!document.hidden)invalidateBattleFrame()});base.querySelectorAll('canvas').forEach(canvas=>canvas.addEventListener('contextrestored',invalidateBattleFrame));
